@baseUrl = http://34.57.154.181:5000
@apiKey = f18724d47bc46ec7cac67f50633fd5508ade65b113215007e09d9c345b571788
@tenantId = f0db1afa-6f46-461d-95a9-65aed91f66ca

### ===============================================
### SERVICIOS
### ===============================================

### 1. Listar Servicios
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/servicios/listar
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ===============================================
### DISPONIBILIDAD
### ===============================================

### 2. Consultar Disponibilidad (Solo Fecha)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/disponibilidad?fecha=2026-01-25
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ===============================================
### CITAS - CREAR
### ===============================================

### 3. Crear Cita (Auto-crea cliente si no existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/crear
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "cliente_nombre": "María García",
  "cliente_telefono": "+34612345678",
  "cliente_email": "maria@email.com",
  "servicio_id": "563e5cc9-ff3c-4e7e-ba35-4d797017e32a",
  "fecha": "2026-01-25",
  "hora": "10:00"
}

### 4. Crear Cita (Cliente existente, sin email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/crear
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "cliente_nombre": "Juan Pérez",
  "cliente_telefono": "+34698765432",
  "servicio_id": "c4b5be70-2357-402f-8a4b-ad922a52e2b3",
  "fecha": "2026-01-26",
  "hora": "14:00"
}

### ===============================================
### CITAS - LISTAR
### ===============================================

### 5. Listar Todas las Citas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/listar
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 6. Listar Citas por Fecha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/listar?fecha=2026-01-25
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 7. Listar Citas por Estado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/listar?estado=confirmada
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 8. Listar Citas por Rango de Fechas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/listar?fecha_inicio=2026-01-20&fecha_fin=2026-01-31
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ===============================================
### CITAS - MODIFICAR
### ===============================================

### 9. Modificar Cita (Cambiar fecha y hora)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/modificar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34612345678",
  "fecha_actual": "2026-01-25",
  "hora_actual": "10:00",
  "nueva_fecha": "2026-01-27",
  "nueva_hora": "14:00"
}

### 10. Modificar Cita (Solo cambiar hora, mismo día)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/modificar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34612345678",
  "fecha_actual": "2026-01-25",
  "hora_actual": "10:00",
  "nueva_fecha": "2026-01-25",
  "nueva_hora": "16:00"
}

### 11. Modificar Cita (Cambiar servicio también)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/modificar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34612345678",
  "fecha_actual": "2026-01-25",
  "hora_actual": "10:00",
  "nueva_fecha": "2026-01-27",
  "nueva_hora": "11:00",
  "nuevo_servicio_id": "bfcaa47b-6efe-48c2-939c-536d9ed6494f"
}

### 12. Modificar Cita (Sin especificar hora_actual - busca única cita del día)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/modificar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34612345678",
  "fecha_actual": "2026-01-25",
  "nueva_fecha": "2026-01-28",
  "nueva_hora": "09:30"
}

### ===============================================
### CITAS - CANCELAR
### ===============================================

### 13. Cancelar Cita (Con hora específica)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/cancelar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34612345678",
  "fecha": "2026-01-25",
  "hora": "10:00",
  "motivo": "Cliente canceló por cambio de planes"
}

### 14. Cancelar Cita (Sin hora - busca única cita del día)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/cancelar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34698765432",
  "fecha": "2026-01-26",
  "motivo": "Cancelación vía WhatsApp"
}

### ===============================================
### CLIENTES
### ===============================================

### 15. Buscar Cliente por Teléfono
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/clientes/buscar?telefono=+34612345678
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 16. Crear Cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/clientes/crear
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "nombre": "Ana López",
  "telefono": "+34611222333",
  "email": "ana@email.com"
}

### ===============================================
### FLUJO COMPLETO: AGENDAR CITA
### ===============================================

### PASO 1: Consultar servicios disponibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/servicios/listar
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### PASO 2: Consultar disponibilidad para una fecha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/disponibilidad?fecha=2026-01-30
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### PASO 3: Crear la cita (auto-crea cliente si no existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/crear
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "cliente_nombre": "Laura Martínez",
  "cliente_telefono": "+34644555666",
  "cliente_email": "laura@email.com",
  "servicio_id": "563e5cc9-ff3c-4e7e-ba35-4d797017e32a",
  "fecha": "2026-01-30",
  "hora": "11:00"
}

### ===============================================
### FLUJO COMPLETO: MODIFICAR CITA
### ===============================================

### PASO 1: Consultar disponibilidad para nueva fecha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/disponibilidad?fecha=2026-02-03
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### PASO 2: Modificar la cita
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/modificar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34644555666",
  "fecha_actual": "2026-01-30",
  "hora_actual": "11:00",
  "nueva_fecha": "2026-02-03",
  "nueva_hora": "15:00"
}

### ===============================================
### CASOS DE ERROR (TESTING)
### ===============================================

### ERROR: Crear cita sin datos obligatorios
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/crear
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "cliente_nombre": "Test Error"
}

### ERROR: Modificar cita que no existe
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/modificar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34999999999",
  "fecha_actual": "2026-01-25",
  "nueva_fecha": "2026-01-27",
  "nueva_hora": "14:00"
}

### ERROR: Cancelar cita que no existe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/cancelar-por-telefono
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "telefono": "+34999999999",
  "fecha": "2026-01-25"
}

### ERROR: Disponibilidad sin fecha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/citas/disponibilidad
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### ERROR: Sin API Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/n8n/servicios/listar

